      "type": "game",
      "name": "My Colony",
      "steam_appid": 964130,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Expand. Rule the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to My Colony, the ultimate sci-fi city builder and space empire simulation. Whether you’re leading a peaceful outpost or an industrial powerhouse, the galaxy is yours to shape — one rover at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Colony</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single lander and rover, gather resources, and unlock a massive tech tree full of structures, utilities, and special units. Every resource leads to new possibilities as you evolve from a basic outpost to a sprawling interplanetary empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of four distinct factions, each with unique tech trees, units, and play styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United Earth – Balanced and tech-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >League of Independent States – Resource-efficient rebels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zolarg Empire – Insectoid swarm-style economics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha Draconians – Advanced reptilian overlords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-city sandbox or Premium Region Mode with connected cities across a shared map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Regions: Cooperate or compete with friends — each sub-city run by a different player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Declare independence from your “mother colony” and start your own empire — with players paying taxes to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form Federations with others to dominate galactic leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Galactic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in daily online challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade on the Galactic Board of Trade, a real-time player-run auction house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance population, GDP, education, security, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the ranks as you scale your economy and influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works offline or online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sync progress with your Ape Apps Account</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a living universe of colonists. Forge alliances. Grow your power. Leave your mark on the stars.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Expand. Rule the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to My Colony, the ultimate sci-fi city builder and space empire simulation. Whether you’re leading a peaceful outpost or an industrial powerhouse, the galaxy is yours to shape — one rover at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Colony</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single lander and rover, gather resources, and unlock a massive tech tree full of structures, utilities, and special units. Every resource leads to new possibilities as you evolve from a basic outpost to a sprawling interplanetary empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of four distinct factions, each with unique tech trees, units, and play styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United Earth – Balanced and tech-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >League of Independent States – Resource-efficient rebels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zolarg Empire – Insectoid swarm-style economics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha Draconians – Advanced reptilian overlords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-city sandbox or Premium Region Mode with connected cities across a shared map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Regions: Cooperate or compete with friends — each sub-city run by a different player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Declare independence from your “mother colony” and start your own empire — with players paying taxes to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form Federations with others to dominate galactic leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Galactic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in daily online challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade on the Galactic Board of Trade, a real-time player-run auction house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance population, GDP, education, security, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the ranks as you scale your economy and influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works offline or online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sync progress with your Ape Apps Account</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a living universe of colonists. Forge alliances. Grow your power. Leave your mark on the stars.</p>",
      "short_description": "Build, expand, and rule a growing space colony. Explore tech, trade, and multiplayer.",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
